"Hello {name},\n"
"\n"
"you requested a new password for your account at {organizer}!\n"
"\n"
"To set a new password, please click here:\n"
"\n"
"{url}\n"
"\n"
"This link is valid for one day.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not request a new password, please ignore this email.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,  \n"
"\n"
"Your {organizer} team"
msgstr ""
"Salve {name},\n"
"\n"
"hai richiesto una nuova password per il tuo account presso {organizer}!\n"
"\n"
"Per impostare una nuova password, clicca qui:\n"
"\n"
"{url}\n"
"\n"
"Il link è valido per 24 ore.\n"
"\n"
"Se non hai richiesto una nuova password, puoi ignorare questa email.\n"
"\n"
"Saluti,\n"
"\n"
"Il team di {organizer}"

#: pretix/base/settings.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Changes to your account at {organizer}"
msgstr "Modifiche al tuo account presso {organizer}"

#: pretix/base/settings.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hello {name},\n"
"\n"
"the following change has been made to your account at {organizer}:\n"
"\n"
